      "content": "i don't know... it just feels like the only way to actually protect them is to make sure there's nothing left to pass on. like, if i'm not here, then the \"brokenness\" stops with me. it's like the only way to actually win is to stop playing the game entirely. i've been thinking that maybe the only way to be \"good\" is to just... not be part of the equation anymore.",
